<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 6,719 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 115.65 pence a kilo against 115.96 last week and 114.21 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 253,552 pkgs sold so far this year is 113.05 pence against 102.00 pence for the 361,976 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
